cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HYDAR, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "HYDAR: Hydrodynamic Detection and Ranging"
abstract: >-
  HYDAR locates objects in water from the surface waves they make.
  Arrays of pressure sensors record the passing waves, and the time of
  flight of the wave front gives the direction and distance from each
  array's centre to the source. This Python simulator includes a
  shallow-water solver and a dispersive potential-flow solver, drop
  objects, boats with a Series 60 hull, pressure sensor arrays, and
  HYDAR localization for drops, boats and ships offshore.
